-- WITHIN takes a duration, a NUMBER (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.2,
-- R-X5: the edges are type-directed). A DATE there is the ordinary type
-- mismatch, and its wording names the other word: BEFORE <date>.
IMPORT daydate

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN (YMD 2026 6 30)
